Package: openetR
Title: Access OpenET Evapotranspiration Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Connor", "Brown", , "ConnorBrown1996@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9680-8930"))
Description: Retrieve raster evapotranspiration time series and metadata
    from the 'OpenET' application programming interface (API). Supports
    point and polygon queries across OpenET raster collections. Returns
    tidy tabular responses where possible for analysis in 'R'.
License: AGPL (>= 3) + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://connorb.github.io/openetR/,
    https://github.com/ConnorB/openetR
BugReports: https://github.com/ConnorB/openetR/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    httr2,
    rlang,
    tibble
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0.9000
